      "value": "<p>Advanced field harmonics let you move as the cloak forms and linger as it fades.</p><p>When you use Tactical Cloak, you can <strong>Stride</strong> up to your Speed as part of the same action. When a Strike ends your cloak, you are <strong>Concealed</strong> until the start of your next turn.</p><p><em>Prerequisite: Tactical Cloak Upgrade. Classes: Infiltrator.</em></p><hr/><p><em>Automation: when a Strike ends the cloak, a Cloak Wake effect makes you Concealed until the start of your next turn. The Stride is yours to take.</em></p>"
